       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DAY05-18-02.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 SOLDE PIC S9(6)V99 VALUE 1000.
       01 SOLDE-INITIAL PIC S9(6)V99 VALUE 2000.
       01 MONTANT-MOUVEMENT PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 150.
       

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
